# What the container builds for itself, and what is a Windows build artefact.
#
# The context is the whole repository, so this file decides how long `docker build` takes. target/
# holds 1 GB of Windows objects that a musl build cannot reuse, and the aports tree, the work tree
# and the output are all recreated inside the container by design.
/target
/iso/aports
/iso/dist
/iso/.cache
/dist
/out
/.cache
.git
*.iso
*.apkovl.tar.gz
